/// [Catalogue] A conversation journey the assistant runs. Legacy J01-J12 are goal-led playbooks (retirement income, scam check, card fit, ...) with triggers, must-establish facts and never-do rules. Frontier F01-F06 are the household journeys, each with specialists, an autonomy ceiling and the operations it may only prepare. Contoso extension entity: no CDM profile entity, BIAN status unmapped. Star role: dimension; grain: one journey (curated reference source). Lakehouse: dim_journey <- Curated reference data.
entity Journey
	lineageTag: 7a79462c-0cd6-5c44-9aa8-df2b3875f888
	backingTable: Journey
	keyProperty: JourneyId

